title SM-01 - Meal Participation and Settlement State

  [*] --> DefaultExpected
  DefaultExpected --> AbsenceReported : Parent reports no meal
  DefaultExpected --> SpecialException : Teacher/Admin exception
  DefaultExpected --> Locked : Cutoff time reached
  AbsenceReported --> Locked : Cutoff time reached
  SpecialException --> Locked : Cutoff time reached
  Locked --> AdjustmentRequested : Post-cutoff change request
  AdjustmentRequested --> Approved : Admin approves
  AdjustmentRequested --> Rejected : Admin rejects
  Approved --> FinalMealState
  Rejected --> FinalMealState
  Locked --> FinalMealState : Serve / report
  FinalMealState --> [*]
